rsonality fans have  been impatiently waiting for frozen -  ever since its epic trailer was released  in February 2019 if there's one thing  fans couldn't help but notice it's how  mature Princess Anna has become she's  put her braided pigtails in the past and  let her hair down for like the first  time ever the top portion is clipped  allowing her banks to frame her face at  the beginning of the trailer we see on a  run out onto her balcony she's wearing  green pajamas which is no big surprise  considering green seems to be her  signature color however on a ditches the  color green wants a new adventure  presents itself much like in frozen  Ana's wearing an off purple cloak  knee-high black boots and a dark purple  dress her new look is a lot darker than  usual does this mean that honest sweet  and jovial personality is going to be  more refined come the sequel we'll have  to wait to find out in the meantime  let's find out just how much Ana's  boyfriend Christoph has changed since we  first laid eyes on him Christoph when we  first meet Christoph he's covered in  snow from head to toe and he's not very  happy about it to say the least  Kurt behind you oh right Christoph is an  ice Harvester by trade so an eternal  winner isn't something that's good for  business your stuff usually wears a  tooth we can still see his shaggy blond  hair peeking out from underneath it  being an ice Harvester means that you  need to be prepared for tough weather  conditions so Christophe is suited up  and ready for action in frozen  Christophe is typically seen wearing his  Brown Pelt coat huge gloves and big  winter boots he's wearing a fuchsia sash  around his waist and the collar of his  coat is lined with the same fabric  he's a low-key matching with honor my  sister you're gonna kill yourself at the  end of the movie when L says winter  spell has been undone we get to see  Christoph in his summer clothes his hat  is nowhere to be found  and his blown locks are doing that  adorable flippy thing he's wearing a  long-sleeve blue shirt with a dark vest  he looks super put together but we  wouldn't expect anything less from  arendelle's official ice master and  deliverer in Olaf's roads an adventure  we see Christoph sporting a brand new  look however his winter outfit is  somewhat similar to the summer outfit we  saw him wearing at the end of frozen  looks like Christoph likes to keep  things simple and functional he's  wearing a light blue long sleeved  undershirts opt with a navy blue vest  the vest has a high collar in a string  of fashionable buttons although his  outfit may be basic you can tell it was  made with quality materials  and since Kristoff and Anna are totally  matching we can only assume that  Christoph's wardrobe received a royal  makeover by the end of the short film  Kristoff is back to wearing his original  ice harvesting outfit some things never  change  and apparently Kristoff style is one of  them although Christoph's classic outfit  didn't receive a total makeover he's  sporting some fresh new clothes in  frozen to whoever's designing his  wardrobe knows that he's a simple man  who likes things to be practical and  warm  Christoph's new look has been revamped  his boots are more elf like while his  sleeves seemed to be made out of warm  fur his sash is no longer fuchsia it's a  dark tan all-in-all Christoph's clothing  is now made with rich materials and it  shows but not much else has changed much  like onna Chris tops color scheme was  taken down a few notches giving him more  of a somber look Queen Elsa  Queen Elsa is typically showcased  wearing the color blue  she is the ice queen after all oddly  enough during her coronation she's  showcased wearing a tulle gown with a  fuchsia cloak her hair is done up in a  braided updo just like Ana's after the  coronation takes a turn for the worst  Queen Elsa flees arendelle and gives  herself a well-deserved makeover she  treats in her teal gown for a blue and  sparkly snowflake inspired dress  it's simply breathtaking she also and  does her updo and lets her braid hang  freely what an epic transformation in  Olaf's frozen adventure Queen Elsa's  outfit isn't too different than the one  showcased in the original film however  this time her gown is midnight blue her  long train is dusted with silvery  snowflakes and her collar is lined with  white fur Elsa's still rocking her  classic braid we can't get over how  majestic the queen of arendelle looks in  this outfit our surprise holiday party  doesn't start until after the Yule bell  ring Elsa's newest look is one for the  books it's super classy and weightless  making it the perfect choice for a royal  adventure else's wearing a light blue  overcoat which is embroidered with  silver designs she's also wearing a  sparkly white gown underneath her coat  Elsa's hair hasn't changed one bit  but her shoe sure have we mean check out  those sparkly knee-high boots they're to  die for so whose new look do you prefer  Elsa honor  Christoph's let us know in the comment  section below and while you're at it  tell us who your favorite frozen  character is and that's a wrap give this  video a big thumbs up if you're excited  for frozen - to hit the theatres and as  usual don't forget to leave a comment  and subscribe to the scenes for the  latest Disney news thanks for watching  we'll see you next time  [Music]
 

